This artifact is authored for Patronus and contains material derived from the
"subagent-driven-development" and "executing-plans" skills of obra/superpowers.

Authored (no upstream counterpart):
  - SKILL.md      the proportionality gate and decision record
  - solo.md       the sequential mode

Authored from the upstream discipline, not lifted from it:
  - sdd.md        derived from skills/subagent-driven-development/SKILL.md

Vendored (upstream paths, unchanged apart from path references):
  - implementer-prompt.md
        from skills/subagent-driven-development/implementer-prompt.md
  - task-reviewer-prompt.md
        from skills/subagent-driven-development/task-reviewer-prompt.md
  - scripts/{task-brief,review-package,sdd-workspace}
        from skills/subagent-driven-development/scripts/

Upstream forks these two skills on subagent CAPABILITY: executing-plans is the
no-subagent fallback, subagent-driven-development the intended path where
subagents exist. Patronus forks on PROPORTIONALITY instead, because all three
targets have subagents and the capability axis has no audience here. That
divergence is why this is a new artifact rather than an edit to a vendored one,
and it is why both upstream skills remain in the catalog, pristine and
re-vendorable.

The scripts/ helpers were audited before shipping: they perform only git reads
and file writes (no network access, no destructive operations).

